 ltdonny@gmail.com wrote:

> I am playing the game, and sometimes dialog will come up saying things
> like, "You heard a cash register" or "You hear a guard on patrol".
> The problem is I usually see it when I am moving or searching, but
> since I am semi-rapidly tapping the keys, I don't get to see the
> message.
> 
> Is there any type of option I can change so the game halts upon a
> perception, much like when there is something written in the ground or
> I cross a grave stone and I have to press enter to proceed?

You get the last 20 messages back with ^p. You can change the number of
back messages in your options (what you get when you press O in the
game): it's "msghistory". Presumably also in an OPTIONS line in
your .nethackrc (or whatever your OS calls that) but I've always been
satisfied with 20.

